{
	"format": 1,
	"comment": "What the scanner can look for, in groups. 'tcp' are the ports tried for a service, 'probes' the probes of the scanner that recognise it by its answer; 'available' false marks a method that is planned but not built yet. 'default' is the choice of a new installation.",
	"groups": [
		{ "id": "discovery", "name": "Finding devices", "icon": "🔎", "items": [
